+/* ext0: one RTC GPIO (RTC_IO_EXT_WAKEUP0.SEL) at EXT_WAKEUP0_LV; ext1: the RTC GPIOs of EXT_WAKEUP1.SEL,
+ * any high (EXT_WAKEUP1_LV 1) or all low (0); GPIO (light sleep only, the digital GPIO stays powered): a pin
